== Effects ==
* Isaac's tears travel in a wave-like pattern.
* +0.4 [[Tears]] up.
* {{dlc|r}} Grants [[spectral tears]].

== Notes ==
* {{dlc+|r+}} This trinket has a 1% chance to drop when defeating {{e|Pin}}, {{e|Larry Jr.}}, {{e|The Hollow}} or {{e|Scolex}}.{{dlc-}}

== Synergies ==
* {{i|Soy Milk}}: Tears now travel in a double helix pattern.
* {{i|Tractor Beam}}: The altered pattern tears travel in is confined to the beam allowing Isaac to use its benefits without losing accuracy.
* {{A|Golden Trinket}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r}}: In addition to further stat increases, each copy causes the path of tears to become even wigglier.
* {{i|Tech X}}: Rings take a star-shape, slightly increasing their area of effect.

