== Trivia ==
* Wiggle Worm was a passive item in the original ''[[wikipedia:The Binding of Isaac (video game)|Binding of Isaac]]''. The likely reason for the change to a trinket is the situational usefulness of this shot pattern, along with the new ability to drop trinkets on demand. It took ItemID #59, which is now unused.
** {{dlc|r}} ItemID #59 is now used by the passive {{I|The Book of Belial}} created by the {{I|Birthright|n}} effect from {{C|Judas}}/{{C|Black Judas}}.

